{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.maintenance","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Maintenance, Repairs & Unit Access","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium common-element maintenance, repair/replacement/restoration, improvement, emergency, and unit-access framework. Asset inventories, work history, access events, costs, and association procedures are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_common_element_maintenance","as_of_date":"2026-09-17","admission_rule":"Only current-effective statewide Illinois condominium maintenance, improvement, emergency, and unit-access requirements are Infrastructure. Asset identities, conditions, inspection cycles, work records, access procedures, costs, and local code requirements are association-instance data or deferred."},"categories":[{"id":"maintenance.common_elements","label":"Common-element maintenance"},{"id":"maintenance.improvements","label":"Repairs, replacement, restoration, and improvements"},{"id":"maintenance.emergency","label":"Emergency work"},{"id":"maintenance.unit_access","label":"Unit access for common-element work"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-18-8","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18(a)(8)(iv)-(v)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18","summary":"Emergency expenditures and additions/alterations assessment rules; defines emergency for this framework."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18-4-a","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.4(a)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.4","summary":"Board duty for operation, care, upkeep, maintenance, replacement, and improvement of common elements; certain improvement expenditures are subject to an owner-petition ratification process."},{"id":"il-condo-act-18-4-j","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/18.4(j)","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K18.4","summary":"Board access to units when necessary for common-element maintenance, repair, replacement, or emergency repairs to prevent damage."}],"pages":[{"id":"maintenance-repairs-access","title":"Maintenance, Repairs & Unit Access","help":"The statewide framework establishes board duties and statutory approval/access boundaries. The association records the physical assets, work history, costs, and access events.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-maintenance-framework","title":"Statewide maintenance and access framework","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-8","il-condo-act-18-4-a","il-condo-act-18-4-j"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"common-element-duty","kind":"notice","text":"The board's powers and duties include providing for the operation, care, upkeep, maintenance, replacement, and improvement of the common elements.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-a"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"repair-limit-boundary","kind":"notice","text":"Condominium-instrument expenditure limits for common elements do not apply to expenditures for repair, replacement, or restoration of existing portions of the common elements.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-a"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"repair-definition","kind":"notice","text":"For Section 18.4(a), repair, replacement, or restoration concerns deteriorated or damaged portions of the property and the functional equivalent of existing decorating, facilities, structural or mechanical components, interior or exterior surfaces, or energy systems and equipment.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-a"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"improvement-petition-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Unless mandated by law or an emergency, an improvement over the original quality that results in a proposed expenditure exceeding 5% of the annual budget is subject to the Section 18.4(a) owner-petition process: owners with 20% of the association votes may petition within 21 days of board approval, and the board must call a unit-owner meeting within 30 days after delivery of the petition. The expenditure is ratified unless a majority of the total unit-owner votes are cast to reject it.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-a"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"emergency-definition","kind":"notice","text":"For this statutory framework, an emergency means an immediate danger to the structural integrity of the common elements or to the life, health, safety, or property of unit owners.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-8"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"emergency-assessment-boundary","kind":"notice","text":"Separate assessments for expenditures relating to emergencies or mandated by law may be adopted by the board without the owner-approval processes that otherwise apply under Section 18(a)(8)(ii) and (v).","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-8"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"unit-access-rule","kind":"notice","text":"The board may have access to each unit from time to time as necessary for maintenance, repair, or replacement of common elements or for emergency repairs necessary to prevent damage to common elements or other units.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-j"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"association-maintenance-configuration","title":"Association maintenance configuration","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-a","il-condo-act-18-4-j"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"maintenance-responsibility-reference","kind":"text","label":"Maintenance responsibility matrix / governing-document reference","binding":"association.maintenance.responsibility_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-plan-reference","kind":"text","label":"Maintenance plan / schedule reference","binding":"association.maintenance.plan_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"emergency-access-procedure-reference","kind":"text","label":"Emergency/unit-access procedure reference","binding":"association.maintenance.access_procedure_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-contact","kind":"text","label":"Maintenance coordination contact / role","binding":"association.maintenance.coordination_contact","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-configuration-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Maintenance configuration notes","binding":"association.maintenance.notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":8}}]},{"id":"common-element-assets","title":"Common-element asset inventory","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-4-a"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"common-element-assets-collection","kind":"collection","label":"Common-element assets","binding":"association.maintenance.assets","min_items":0,"item_label":"Asset","actions":{"add_label":"Add asset","remove_label":"Remove asset"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"maintenance-asset-id","kind":"text","label":"Asset identifier","binding":"asset_id","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-asset-name","kind":"text","label":"Asset / system","binding":"name","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":3}},{"id":"maintenance-asset-location","kind":"text","label":"Location","binding":"location","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":6,"span":3}},{"id":"maintenance-asset-responsibility","kind":"select","label":"Observed responsibility","binding":"responsibility","options":[{"value":"association","label":"Association"},{"value":"unit_owner","label":"Unit owner"},{"value":"shared_or_conditional","label":"Shared / conditional"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-asset-condition","kind":"select","label":"Observed condition","binding":"condition","options":[{"value":"good","label":"Good"},{"value":"monitor","label":"Monitor"},{"value":"repair_needed","label":"Repair needed"},{"value":"replacement_needed","label":"Replacement needed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"maintenance-asset-last-inspection","kind":"date","label":"Last inspection","binding":"last_inspection","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-asset-next-review","kind":"date","label":"Next review / service","binding":"next_review","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-asset-record-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Record / drawing / warranty reference","binding":"record_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":8,"span":5}}]}]},{"id":"maintenance-events","title":"Maintenance, repair, replacement, and access events","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-18-8","il-condo-act-18-4-a","il-condo-act-18-4-j"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"maintenance-events-collection","kind":"collection","label":"Maintenance events","binding":"association.maintenance.events","min_items":0,"item_label":"Maintenance event","actions":{"add_label":"Add maintenance event","remove_label":"Remove maintenance event"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"maintenance-event-asset-reference","kind":"text","label":"Asset reference","binding":"asset_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-event-type","kind":"select","label":"Event type","binding":"event_type","options":[{"value":"inspection","label":"Inspection"},{"value":"maintenance","label":"Maintenance"},{"value":"repair","label":"Repair"},{"value":"replacement","label":"Replacement"},{"value":"restoration","label":"Restoration"},{"value":"improvement","label":"Improvement"},{"value":"emergency_repair","label":"Emergency repair"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":3}},{"id":"maintenance-event-date","kind":"date","label":"Event / approval date","binding":"event_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":6,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-event-status","kind":"select","label":"Status","binding":"status","options":[{"value":"planned","label":"Planned"},{"value":"approved","label":"Approved"},{"value":"in_progress","label":"In progress"},{"value":"completed","label":"Completed"},{"value":"cancelled","label":"Cancelled"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":8,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-event-cost","kind":"number","label":"Cost / approved expenditure","binding":"cost","min":0,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"maintenance-event-work-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Work order / contract / invoice reference","binding":"work_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-event-board-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Board action / meeting reference","binding":"board_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-event-statutory-path","kind":"select","label":"Observed statutory path","binding":"statutory_path","options":[{"value":"ordinary_repair_replacement_restoration","label":"Repair / replacement / restoration"},{"value":"improvement_under_5_percent","label":"Improvement — 5% threshold not exceeded"},{"value":"improvement_over_5_percent_no_petition","label":"Improvement over 5% — no petition observed"},{"value":"improvement_over_5_percent_petition","label":"Improvement over 5% — petition process invoked"},{"value":"emergency","label":"Emergency"},{"value":"mandated_by_law","label":"Mandated by law"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-event-petition-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Owner petition / ratification reference","binding":"petition_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-event-emergency-basis","kind":"textarea","label":"Emergency / mandated-law basis","binding":"emergency_or_mandate_basis","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-event-unit-access-required","kind":"checkbox","label":"Unit access required","binding":"unit_access_required","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-event-unit-reference","kind":"text","label":"Unit reference","binding":"unit_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":11,"span":2}},{"id":"maintenance-event-access-date","kind":"date","label":"Unit access date","binding":"access_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"maintenance-event-access-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Access notice / event reference","binding":"access_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":4,"span":4}},{"id":"maintenance-event-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Event notes / evidence reference","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":8,"span":5}}]}]}]}]}